OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind' mental health team earn
OL,4,A'outstanding' rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FInpatient mental health care at two
OL,7,Fcounty hospitals has been rated as
OL,8,Foutstanding overall following an
OL,9,Finspection in July.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Finspected acute wards for working age
OL,13,Fadults and psychiatric intensive care
OL,14,Funits at St Mary's Hospital in
OL,15,FKettering and Berrywood Hospital in
OL,16,FNorthampton.
OL,18,FThe Northamptonshire Healthcare NHS
OL,19,FFoundation Trust was also rated
OL,20,Foutstanding for how effective and
OL,21,Fwell-led it was and good for safety,
OL,22,Fcare and responsiveness.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
