OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind' mental health team earn
OL,4,A'outstanding' rating
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We found a strong leadership who
OL,7,Fcreated an exceptional culture of
OL,8,Flearning, openness, and continuous
OL,9,Fimprovement, which led to better
OL,10,Fresults," said Gemma Berry, CQC deputy
OL,11,Fdirector of Mental Health in the
OL,12,FMidlands.
